  "title": "VINFAST INDIA PARTNERS WITH SHRIRAM FINANCE TO STRENGTHEN EV FINANCING ACCESSIBILITY",
  "summary": "Gurugram, June 23, 2026 – VinFast India, the Indian subsidiary of global electric vehicle manufacturer VinFast, has signed a strategic Memorandum of Understanding (MoU) with Shriram Finance Limited (SFL), one of India’s largest retail NBFCs, to enhance consumers’ access to financing solutions and support the wider adoption of electric mobility in the country.",
